title: >
  Degradation-Aware Optimal Sizing Framework for
  Grid-Interactive EV Charging Stations with PV, BESS,
  and Supercapacitor: Real Dataset Validation Using
  NASA PCoE, ACN-Data, and CHARGED -- Simulation Results
  and Validation Data

