keywords:
  - EV charging station
  - optimal sizing
  - battery degradation
  - supercapacitor
  - photovoltaic
  - Grey Wolf Optimizer
  - NASA PCoE
  - ACN-Data
  - CHARGED dataset
  - metaheuristic optimization
  - hybrid energy storage
  - Friedman test
  - Wilcoxon test
  - statistical validation

abstract: >
  This dataset contains all numerical results, statistical
  validation data, sensitivity analysis outputs, and
  publication figures supporting the paper submitted to
  Modern Power Systems and Clean Energy (MPCE). The
  repository includes optimal sizing results for four
  case studies and four algorithms (GWO, BBO, AO, ARO),
  30-run statistical validation with Friedman and Wilcoxon
  tests, sensitivity analysis for the degradation parameter
  and sub-hourly peak factor, and all publication figures.
  GWO achieves a mean TAC of $20,683/yr with CV=0.053%
  across 30 independent runs, confirming near-deterministic
  performance on this mixed-integer sizing problem.

